WEBVTT

00:12:29.042 --> 00:12:31.476
and everywhere in the world,

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:35.893
this means women in politics,
women in business

00:12:35.917 --> 00:12:39.958
and women in positions of power
making important decisions.

00:12:42.833 --> 00:12:46.042
It took me 23 years to get here.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.851
But I don't want any girl or any woman

00:12:50.875 --> 00:12:54.583
to take 23 years of her life
to make herself heard.

00:12:56.458 --> 00:12:58.917
I have had some dark days.